WEBVTT

00:00:15.950 --> 00:00:19.450
No!

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:29.750
Azuna? Azuna!

00:00:29.750 --> 00:00:36.300
Azuna! Azuna! Azuna! Azuna!

00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:38.890
Azuna! Azuna!

00:01:10.800 --> 00:01:15.550
<i>Long night under the
midnight sun, I'd gone numb</i>

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.510
<i>Disparaging mutters are
meaningless, aren't they?</i>

00:01:20.510 --> 00:01:25.440
<i>The light sputtering, dying away in my heart</i>

00:01:25.440 --> 00:01:30.360
<i>If I could just grasp it</i>

00:01:30.400 --> 00:01:34.610
<i>Come on, rise to tomorrow!</i>

00:01:34.610 --> 00:01:42.790
<i>When the awakening comes, let loose
a passionate aria, an unending song</i>

00:01:42.790 --> 00:01:47.870
<i>A breathtaking judgment that
echoes in the chambers of the heart</i>

00:01:47.870 --> 00:01:52.460
<i>You can never unsee it</i>

00:01:52.460 --> 00:01:55.210
<i>Two libidos with a chance to meet</i>

00:01:55.210 --> 00:02:02.390
<i>If you seek an era without
overhunting, look no further</i>

00:02:02.390 --> 00:02:12.020
<i>Dancing together stirs our blood,
we rend the veil of darkness</i>

00:02:12.020 --> 00:02:19.320
<i>Together in front of the door,
we're flooded with adrenaline,</i>

00:02:19.320 --> 00:02:21.820
<i>Bewitched by the devil</i>

00:02:22.990 --> 00:02:28.000
"War Cry of Secrets and Contrariness"

00:02:39.260 --> 00:02:40.640
Ritsuka!

00:03:15.800 --> 00:03:19.470
So Ritsuka was the grimoire--who knew?

00:03:19.470 --> 00:03:22.140
Here we kept thinking it was just a book.

00:03:22.140 --> 00:03:27.100
That Rem--"Vienna," he says! What bullshit!

00:03:27.100 --> 00:03:31.770
Rem must have known.
What was he trying to protect?

00:03:32.650 --> 00:03:37.110
So those shivers were because
Ritsuka herself was the grimoire.

00:03:37.110 --> 00:03:40.320
I <i>knew</i> she was special!

00:03:41.990 --> 00:03:46.870
Dammit. I can't track Ritsuka's scent.

00:03:46.870 --> 00:03:50.830
Seems the butterfly
has flown off with her knight.

00:03:53.420 --> 00:03:56.340
Aw. Oh, well.

00:03:56.340 --> 00:04:02.260
You weren't so special after all.
Poor thing. Poor, <i>poor</i> thing.

00:04:05.760 --> 00:04:09.220
Hey! Don't just leave me here, you meanies!

00:04:21.320 --> 00:04:24.200
What are you waiting for?

00:04:25.740 --> 00:04:28.160
How difficult it must have been,

00:04:28.160 --> 00:04:33.000
with your own sister the grimoire.

00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:39.090
But your wise judgment has made
it possible for the Exorcist Society

00:04:39.090 --> 00:04:42.010
to keep the grimoire safe.

00:04:43.220 --> 00:04:45.970
Surely Azuna, too, will be rewarded.

00:04:51.220 --> 00:04:57.810
You need no longer worry.
Rest, now, you and your sister both.

00:04:59.570 --> 00:05:01.980
I am grateful for your kindness.

00:05:06.570 --> 00:05:08.070
Azuna!

00:05:18.040 --> 00:05:20.750
Lindo? Where are we?

00:05:20.750 --> 00:05:22.840
The Exorcist Society.

00:05:22.840 --> 00:05:27.640
Until the grimoire's power fades
at the full moon after your birthday,

00:05:27.640 --> 00:05:28.760
you'll be safe here.

00:05:28.760 --> 00:05:31.310
Azuna! What about Azuna?

00:05:32.850 --> 00:05:38.060
No... it's all my fault... Why?

00:05:38.060 --> 00:05:40.190
If this is what it's come to,

00:05:40.190 --> 00:05:41.520
--I'd be better off dead!

00:05:41.520 --> 00:05:43.780
--No! That's crazy talk!
--I'd be better off dead!

00:05:43.780 --> 00:05:46.450
Azuna wouldn't have wanted that.

00:05:51.660 --> 00:05:53.240
This is...

00:05:55.660 --> 00:06:00.250
Azuna was always afraid.
Afraid you'd find out she was an exorcist

00:06:00.250 --> 00:06:03.300
and she'd lose you as a friend.

00:06:03.300 --> 00:06:05.420
But you accepted her.

00:06:05.420 --> 00:06:10.640
She was so happy to be able
to protect you openly like that.

00:06:12.680 --> 00:06:15.430
Don't let her feelings be in vain.

00:06:32.910 --> 00:06:34.410
Ritsuka?

00:06:34.410 --> 00:06:40.120
Lindo... my big brother...
don't go anywhere, okay?

00:06:40.120 --> 00:06:42.960
I won't. Promise.

00:06:44.300 --> 00:06:46.880
I'll always be at your side.

00:07:03.060 --> 00:07:06.940
May the dark forces
dwelling in this flesh be purified.

00:07:06.940 --> 00:07:09.360
Receive now the seal of the sacred Light,

00:07:09.360 --> 00:07:12.620
that thou art led not astray
by thy wicked heart.

00:07:21.120 --> 00:07:22.960
Endure it, Lindo.

00:07:22.960 --> 00:07:26.590
In so doing, the impurity
within you will be cleansed.

00:07:29.970 --> 00:07:34.470
I believe whole-heartedly
in your loyalty, my brother.

00:07:34.470 --> 00:07:35.970
Continue.

00:07:44.980 --> 00:07:47.480
Where've you been, Mage?

00:07:48.480 --> 00:07:51.860
Maybe don't rely on your nose
so much and start using your head.

00:07:51.860 --> 00:07:55.870
Eh? And why are you two just hangin' around?

00:07:55.870 --> 00:07:59.500
We want that butterfly ASAP.

00:07:59.500 --> 00:08:03.330
But right now she's behind a powerful barrier.

00:08:08.420 --> 00:08:10.420
The exorcists' den.

00:08:10.420 --> 00:08:15.930
Not that she's necessarily <i>safe</i> in there...

00:08:23.730 --> 00:08:25.020
Ritsuka?

00:08:25.020 --> 00:08:29.570
O sacred and merciful Light,

00:08:29.570 --> 00:08:32.030
--we worship your greatness
and work joyfully on your behalf.

00:08:32.030 --> 00:08:36.620
--My apologies for summoning you here.
--we worship your greatness
and work joyfully on your behalf.

00:08:36.620 --> 00:08:37.320
--Wh-What is this?

00:08:37.320 --> 00:08:38.830
--Would that we who are weak
and lowly may serve you eternally.
--Wh-What is this?

00:08:38.830 --> 00:08:41.410
--Would that we who are weak
and lowly may serve you eternally.
--Ritsuka Tachibana.

00:08:41.410 --> 00:08:43.410
--Would that we who are weak
and lowly may serve you eternally.
--You have fallen in too deeply

00:08:43.410 --> 00:08:45.500
--O sacred Power,
--with agents of darkness.

00:08:45.500 --> 00:08:49.920
--your love is everlasting,
your mercy as a bottomless ravine.
--Therefore, you shall undergo
a ceremony to cleanse your impurity.

00:08:49.920 --> 00:08:51.460
--My brother--where's Lindo?

00:08:51.460 --> 00:08:52.970
--We call upon your Name
--My brother--where's Lindo?

00:08:52.970 --> 00:08:54.800
--To be beside you now would
have an adverse influence on him.

00:08:54.800 --> 00:08:58.680
--to cast aside the haughty and sinister,
and light our way forevermore.
--To be beside you now would
have an adverse influence on him.

00:08:58.680 --> 00:08:59.970
--to cast aside one haughty and sinister,
and light our way forevermore.

00:08:59.970 --> 00:09:04.060
--to cast aside one haughty and sinister,
and light our way forevermore.
--Now: be seated.

00:09:04.640 --> 00:09:08.190
We offer our prayers to the Light.

00:09:08.190 --> 00:09:11.980
May the sacred Power protect us

00:09:11.980 --> 00:09:15.450
that we may triumph over evil.

00:09:15.450 --> 00:09:16.820
--We offer our prayers to the Light.

00:09:16.820 --> 00:09:18.910
--What are you--
--We offer our prayers to the Light.

00:09:18.910 --> 00:09:20.830
--No! Let me go!
--May the sacred Power protect us

00:09:20.830 --> 00:09:22.370
--May the sacred Power protect us

00:09:22.370 --> 00:09:22.910
--that we may triumph--

00:09:22.910 --> 00:09:24.040
--Ritsuka!
--that we may triumph--

00:09:26.870 --> 00:09:28.250
Lindo!

00:09:29.670 --> 00:09:31.800
What is the meaning of this?

00:09:31.800 --> 00:09:36.970
Lindo. To protect this world,
our best course of action

00:09:36.970 --> 00:09:40.890
is to eliminate the grimoire itself.

00:09:40.890 --> 00:09:42.720
What...

00:09:42.720 --> 00:09:44.980
The Exorcist Society that
means to protect the world

00:09:44.980 --> 00:09:48.730
would kill someone?
Would murder Ritsuka?!

00:09:48.730 --> 00:09:53.030
In fulfilling our duty to save all humanity,

00:09:53.030 --> 00:09:55.740
some amount of pain is inevitable.

00:09:55.740 --> 00:09:59.950
We believe her sacrifice
is the correct decision,

00:09:59.950 --> 00:10:04.500
revealed to us by divine guidance and will.

00:10:04.500 --> 00:10:06.000
You've gone mad.

00:10:07.000 --> 00:10:10.540
Hold your tongue, Lindo. After all...

00:10:10.540 --> 00:10:15.420
it's only natural for a dhampir
like you to be unable to understand

00:10:15.420 --> 00:10:16.970
our noble ideas.

00:10:18.510 --> 00:10:22.300
Oh, hadn't you told your sister?

00:10:22.300 --> 00:10:25.640
What a pity! Listen closely:

00:10:25.640 --> 00:10:31.020
Your brother is a dhampir--
born of a human and a vampire.

00:10:31.020 --> 00:10:34.110
A dhampir? My brother?

00:10:35.360 --> 00:10:40.070
Hand her over. Think rationally,
Lindo, and you'll understand.

00:10:40.070 --> 00:10:44.290
The well-being of this world must come first!

00:10:44.290 --> 00:10:51.960
There is no nobler duty than
to offer oneself up for all humanity.

00:10:51.960 --> 00:10:54.380
Then why don't <i>you</i> die?!

00:10:56.050 --> 00:10:57.550
By the sacred Name,

00:10:57.550 --> 00:10:59.470
I exorcise thee!

00:11:01.550 --> 00:11:02.680
Run!

00:11:12.100 --> 00:11:12.690
Lindo!

00:11:12.690 --> 00:11:14.770
Look, we'll talk later!

00:11:17.360 --> 00:11:20.490
After them! Our holy war has begun!

00:11:20.490 --> 00:11:24.070
Reduce the tome of disaster to ashes!
Kill the girl!

00:11:24.070 --> 00:11:28.540
Kill Ritsuka? Who asked you, anyway?

00:11:29.870 --> 00:11:33.130
As if I'd let her be done in
by the likes of you.

00:11:33.130 --> 00:11:36.090
She's mine!

00:11:36.090 --> 00:11:40.340
What are you talking about?
Ritsuka's my butterfly!

00:11:40.340 --> 00:11:45.850
Oh, stop. No one wants to see
two underdogs yapping at each other.

00:11:45.850 --> 00:11:48.180
Who do you think you are?!

00:11:48.180 --> 00:11:50.680
Devils! Destroy them!

00:11:50.680 --> 00:11:54.480
Those chumps, destroy us?
But they're even lower than dogs.

00:11:54.480 --> 00:11:58.650
How egregiously presumptuous!
Discipline is in order.

00:11:58.650 --> 00:12:01.740
Fine by me. I'll crush 'em.

00:12:13.420 --> 00:12:16.000
We'll stay here until daybreak.

00:12:20.840 --> 00:12:26.680
Lindo... was that--are you...

00:12:26.680 --> 00:12:33.730
It's true. My father was a vampire,
and I his descendant: a dhampir.

00:12:33.730 --> 00:12:37.560
No... Then am I...

00:12:37.560 --> 00:12:39.730
No, you aren't.

00:12:40.730 --> 00:12:43.570
Ritsuka, we...

00:12:44.570 --> 00:12:47.030
We aren't really brother and sister.

00:12:59.920 --> 00:13:01.590
Mommy?

00:13:04.260 --> 00:13:05.300
Who's this?

00:13:05.300 --> 00:13:07.890
It's me, Mommy.

00:13:07.890 --> 00:13:14.730
I have no children.
My darling Lindo was eaten by a monster.

00:13:15.890 --> 00:13:19.270
Tell me: who are you?

00:13:33.000 --> 00:13:33.950
Bubba?

00:13:34.960 --> 00:13:40.130
Lindo, be a real big brother
for Ritsuka now, okay?

00:13:43.130 --> 00:13:44.130
Uh-huh.

00:13:45.760 --> 00:13:48.720
So Aunt Marta was...

00:13:48.720 --> 00:13:51.060
My real mother.

00:13:51.060 --> 00:13:55.140
She was so heartsick to learn
she would bear a vampire's child,

00:13:55.140 --> 00:13:56.140
she just...

00:13:56.140 --> 00:13:57.640
That's awful...

00:13:57.640 --> 00:14:01.980
But I wasn't alone. I had Grandfather, Mom...

00:14:01.980 --> 00:14:03.610
...and you.

00:14:03.610 --> 00:14:05.400
You were there for me.

00:14:08.700 --> 00:14:09.820
Bubba!

00:14:10.820 --> 00:14:13.370
A dwagonfly! Look! Look!

00:14:16.120 --> 00:14:18.750
Ritsuka! You all right?

00:14:18.750 --> 00:14:22.380
The dwagonfly! Is it okay?

00:14:22.380 --> 00:14:25.760
Yep. It flew right off.

00:14:25.760 --> 00:14:27.420
Yay!

00:14:33.560 --> 00:14:34.810
Bubba?

00:14:34.810 --> 00:14:40.100
S-Sorry, I--I think I caught a cold.
I don't want you to get sick.

00:14:40.100 --> 00:14:42.690
B-Better stay away.

00:14:42.690 --> 00:14:47.400
I'll warm you up! See? Aren't I warm?

00:14:50.450 --> 00:14:52.200
You sure are.

00:14:55.740 --> 00:15:01.250
Lindo, this training will control
the evil blood running through you.

00:15:01.250 --> 00:15:04.380
Don't worry. You'll make it through.

00:15:13.510 --> 00:15:15.430
Big brother!

00:15:15.430 --> 00:15:16.600
Ritsuka?

00:15:16.600 --> 00:15:20.390
I came to save you, big brother!

00:15:20.390 --> 00:15:23.810
Thanks. But I'll be all right.

00:15:23.810 --> 00:15:27.990
I'm taking lessons so I can have a strong heart.

00:15:27.990 --> 00:15:31.030
Huh! Then I'm gonna do lessons, too!

00:15:31.030 --> 00:15:34.410
You don't have to, 'cause I'm gonna protect you.

00:15:34.410 --> 00:15:36.870
Protect me?

00:15:36.870 --> 00:15:41.370
Yep. I'm gonna get strong
and keep you safe for always.

00:15:41.370 --> 00:15:44.960
I'd do anything for you, Ritsuka!

00:15:45.880 --> 00:15:50.550
I only made you anxious with
all the things I kept from you.

00:15:50.550 --> 00:15:52.090
I'm sorry.

00:15:52.090 --> 00:15:57.890
Don't be. You did it all for me--I see that now.

00:15:58.890 --> 00:16:02.440
Even if you're really my cousin,
even knowing you're a dhampir,

00:16:02.440 --> 00:16:06.520
you'll always be my precious family.

00:16:06.520 --> 00:16:09.940
And that'll never change, no matter what.

00:16:17.450 --> 00:16:20.660
Thank you for always protecting me.

00:16:23.580 --> 00:16:28.460
I thought I'd be fine just being
beside you, keeping you safe.

00:16:28.460 --> 00:16:29.880
Big brother?

00:16:30.880 --> 00:16:36.050
Every time you've called me that,
I've kept my own feelings at bay...

00:16:39.310 --> 00:16:42.640
Your smile is what always saved me.

00:16:42.640 --> 00:16:46.900
I'm this ambiguous being,
neither human nor vampire,

00:16:46.900 --> 00:16:50.150
and you gave me meaning.

00:16:50.150 --> 00:16:54.320
I wanted to protect you--
not as a brother, but...

00:16:54.320 --> 00:16:57.240
Ritsuka, I have feelings for you.

00:16:57.240 --> 00:16:59.870
I love you--more than anyone else.

00:17:12.760 --> 00:17:17.300
Rem Kaginuki. Come for the grimoire, have you?

00:17:17.300 --> 00:17:19.810
But I'll keep Ritsuka safe.

00:17:19.810 --> 00:17:21.430
I...

00:17:25.560 --> 00:17:26.560
Rem?

00:17:26.560 --> 00:17:29.020
Don't be deceived, Ritsuka.

00:17:29.020 --> 00:17:32.440
There's not a speck of truth
in anything these devils say or do!

00:17:36.610 --> 00:17:41.790
I'll settle this today--so you can
never lay a hand on Ritsuka again!

00:17:41.790 --> 00:17:43.160
Yes.

00:17:43.160 --> 00:17:46.080
♪ I won't let anyone have her ♪

00:17:46.080 --> 00:17:48.540
♪ She is dear to me ♪

00:17:48.540 --> 00:17:51.590
♪ I won't let anyone touch her ♪

00:17:51.590 --> 00:17:54.300
♪ I want to be touching her ♪

00:17:54.300 --> 00:17:59.220
♪ I don't care if it's just us two in this world ♪

00:17:59.220 --> 00:18:03.640
♪ Even if it goes against my destiny ♪

00:18:03.640 --> 00:18:08.940
♪ Know now with every fiber of your being ♪

00:18:08.940 --> 00:18:14.360
♪ Just how much I love her ♪

00:18:14.360 --> 00:18:19.110
♪ A deeper pain than the wounds my body bears ♪

00:18:19.110 --> 00:18:25.290
♪ I feel a tightening just to think of her ♪

00:18:27.580 --> 00:18:31.250
What's wrong?
Guess the devils' power is fading, too!

00:18:33.170 --> 00:18:38.590
Whoever you are, you're no match for Rem Arlond!

00:18:38.590 --> 00:18:40.430
♪ My little shine! ♪

00:18:40.430 --> 00:18:44.060
♪ You shine on me in my lonely times  ♪

00:18:44.060 --> 00:18:45.720
♪ My love, a sign! ♪

00:18:45.720 --> 00:18:50.190
♪ You've stolen my eternity away ♪

00:18:50.190 --> 00:18:55.320
♪ You're too dear--I so long to hold you,
I'm falling apart ♪

00:18:55.320 --> 00:19:02.950
♪ It's too heartbreaking--I want you so badly,
it's burning me up ♪

00:19:02.950 --> 00:19:08.250
♪ It can't be stopped! I want it all ♪

00:19:08.250 --> 00:19:13.210
♪ These feelings are non-negotiable ♪

00:19:13.210 --> 00:19:15.210
♪ I don't want to let her go ♪

00:19:15.210 --> 00:19:18.970
♪ She's my destiny ♪

00:19:26.560 --> 00:19:30.730
Give it up. You can't protect her.

00:19:30.730 --> 00:19:33.610
I would die for her!

00:19:33.610 --> 00:19:35.690
As you wish.

00:19:35.690 --> 00:19:36.980
Rem!

00:19:38.320 --> 00:19:41.740
You want the grimoire so badly
you'd take someone's life?

00:19:41.740 --> 00:19:43.700
You <i>are</i> a devil!

00:19:43.700 --> 00:19:45.950
A cruel, cold-blooded devil!

00:19:47.490 --> 00:19:51.040
Why aren't you saying anything?
What are you thinking?

00:19:51.040 --> 00:19:52.710
I have no idea!

00:19:53.710 --> 00:19:54.170
Ritsuka--

00:19:54.170 --> 00:19:57.800
I'm done letting you
hurt the people closest to me!

00:19:59.010 --> 00:20:00.720
I...

00:20:00.720 --> 00:20:04.300
I hate you! I despise you!

00:20:05.800 --> 00:20:07.970
It's not over yet!

00:20:14.940 --> 00:20:17.570
Don't ever come back.

00:20:22.240 --> 00:20:23.910
Lindo!

00:20:23.910 --> 00:20:25.620
You're bleeding...

00:20:25.620 --> 00:20:28.410
I can handle... this much...

00:20:28.410 --> 00:20:31.080
Let's get you to a hospital.

00:20:31.080 --> 00:20:32.870
No hospitals.

00:20:32.870 --> 00:20:36.960
Things would get complicated if
anyone found out I'm not a normal human.

00:20:53.890 --> 00:20:55.600
I'm sorry.

00:20:57.940 --> 00:21:01.230
I don't need the grimoire's power.

00:21:01.230 --> 00:21:02.740
Azuna...

00:21:02.740 --> 00:21:06.450
Mom... Grandfather... I--

00:21:15.250 --> 00:21:17.710
I can't let it all be for nothing.

00:21:19.790 --> 00:21:22.710
I have to live. For my brother,

00:21:22.710 --> 00:21:26.470
for my loved ones, to keep them safe.
I'll go on living.

00:21:28.390 --> 00:21:30.220
Goodbye.

00:21:36.770 --> 00:21:40.610
I am on my way to seize the girl.

00:21:40.610 --> 00:21:44.030
I'm counting on you, Jek.

00:21:44.030 --> 00:21:49.280
Incidentally, Lord Nesta...
what do you mean to do with the young sir?

00:21:49.280 --> 00:21:54.750
Ah, him? His life is entirely
in the palm of my hand.

00:21:56.120 --> 00:21:59.630
<i>It's a secret you can't tell anyone</i>

00:21:59.630 --> 00:22:10.220
<i>Wonth gir sliv edhti wecnad</i>

00:22:10.220 --> 00:22:11.680
<i>Wonth gir</i>

00:22:13.810 --> 00:22:17.310
<i>Cracking a smile only at the witching hour</i>

00:22:17.310 --> 00:22:20.270
<i>Spreading rumors sotto voce</i>

00:22:20.270 --> 00:22:22.770
<i>You knocked on the door</i>

00:22:22.770 --> 00:22:26.320
<i>Without looking behind you</i>

00:22:26.320 --> 00:22:29.990
<i>With all these mysteries, impossible to solve</i>

00:22:29.990 --> 00:22:32.910
<i>You stopped cold, weak in the knees</i>

00:22:32.910 --> 00:22:35.410
<i>It hacks everything</i>

00:22:35.410 --> 00:22:37.710
<i>The curse of love</i>

00:22:37.710 --> 00:22:39.960
<i>The curse--and you</i>

00:22:39.960 --> 00:22:44.380
<i>If you're confused about the touch on your skin</i>

00:22:44.380 --> 00:22:48.010
<i>We just can't be transparent</i>

00:22:48.010 --> 00:22:51.850
<i>Soon (soon)</i>

00:22:51.850 --> 00:22:54.560
<i>Won't you take this hand?</i>

00:22:54.560 --> 00:23:02.270
<i>Mademoiselle, mademoiselle:
I'll make you happy</i>

00:23:02.270 --> 00:23:06.070
<i>This night will never come again</i>

00:23:06.070 --> 00:23:08.950
<i>So let us swear to one another</i>

00:23:08.950 --> 00:23:16.240
<i>The black clown singing of love
at the tip of the moon</i>

00:23:16.240 --> 00:23:18.040
<i>Obscuring the sky</i>

00:23:18.040 --> 00:23:23.000
<i>Casting a spell with a bewitching fever</i>

00:23:27.300 --> 00:23:28.800
Give her to me.

00:23:28.800 --> 00:23:30.510
She's mine!

00:23:30.510 --> 00:23:33.260
I won't let anyone else have my butterfly.

00:23:33.260 --> 00:23:36.510
Hands off the grimoire!

00:23:36.390 --> 00:23:40.980
"Tarantella of Desire and Deceit"

00:23:36.560 --> 00:23:40.890
Act 10: Tarantella of Desire and Deceit.
